# Cross-cutting session and Origin rules: a logged-out session is dead, and UnsafeCookieRequestOriginMiddleware refuses an unsafe
# cookie-bearing request or any login whose Origin is not the configured WebUI (403, before the route or the CSRF check runs).

@AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress = {{$processEnv AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}
@WebUI_Origin = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_WEBUI_ORIGIN}}
@SessionEmail = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_ADMIN_EMAIL}}
@SessionPassword = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_ADMIN_PASSWORD}}
@ForeignOrigin = https://evil.example.com
@OriginDetail = Unsafe authenticated API requests require an allowed Origin header.

### [Setup][Authz] Clear any session cookie left by a previous file (204, 401 or 403, not asserted)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}

###

### [Setup][Authz] Login with the admin account (200 expected)
# @name csrfSource1
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{SessionEmail}}", "password": "{{SessionPassword}}" }

{{
  exports.CsrfToken = response.headers['set-cookie']?.find(c => c.startsWith('__Host-arsm-csrf-token='))?.match(/^__Host-arsm-csrf-token=([^;]+)/)?.[1];
}}

?? status == 200

###

### [Positive][Authz] Session is authenticated before logout (200 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/validate

?? status == 200
?? js response.parsedBody.isAdmin == true

###

### [Setup][Authz] Logout (204 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 204

###

### [Negative][Authz] The session is dead after logout, on the session check (401 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/validate

?? status == 401

###

### [Negative][Authz] An admin route answers 401 after logout (401 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/admin/mechanics

?? status == 401

###

### [Negative][Authz] A login from a foreign Origin is refused, which blocks login CSRF (403 expected)
# @no-cookie-jar
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{ForeignOrigin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{SessionEmail}}", "password": "{{SessionPassword}}" }

?? status == 403
?? js (response.parsedBody.detail == OriginDetail) == true

###

### [Negative][Authz] A login without an Origin header is refused (403 expected)
# @no-cookie-jar
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{SessionEmail}}", "password": "{{SessionPassword}}" }

?? status == 403

###

### [Setup][Authz] Login with the admin account again for the cross-origin checks (200 expected)
# @name csrfSource2
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{SessionEmail}}", "password": "{{SessionPassword}}" }

{{
  exports.CsrfToken = response.headers['set-cookie']?.find(c => c.startsWith('__Host-arsm-csrf-token='))?.match(/^__Host-arsm-csrf-token=([^;]+)/)?.[1];
}}

?? status == 200

###

### [Negative][Authz] Unsafe request with a foreign Origin and valid cookies is refused (403 expected, stable detail)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{ForeignOrigin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 403
?? js (response.parsedBody.detail == OriginDetail) == true

###

### [Negative][Authz] An admin mutation with a foreign Origin is refused before the route runs (403 expected, not 404)
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/admin/mechanics/999999
Origin: {{ForeignOrigin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 403
?? js (response.parsedBody.detail == OriginDetail) == true

###

### [Negative][Authz] An unsafe request without an Origin header is refused (403 expected, not 404)
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/admin/mechanics/999999
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 403

###

### [Negative][Authz] The Origin "null" is refused (403 expected)
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/admin/mechanics/999999
Origin: null
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 403

###

### [Negative][Authz] An Origin that only starts with the WebUI origin is refused (403 expected, exact match)
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/admin/mechanics/999999
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}.evil.example.com
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 403

###

### [Positive][Authz] A safe request is not Origin-checked: a foreign Origin on a GET still reads (200 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/validate
Origin: {{ForeignOrigin}}

?? status == 200

###

### [Positive][Authz] The configured Origin passes the same unsafe route, which then answers from the handler (404 expected)
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/admin/mechanics/999999
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 404

###

### [Positive][Authz] The session survived every rejected attempt (200 expected)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/validate

?? status == 200

###

### [Setup][Authz] Logout with the correct Origin (204 expected, cleanup)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 204
